 ],
 "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://galeriasavaria.hu/termekek/reszletek/otthon-haztartas-kellekei/8535680\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Perrier-Jouët Belle Époque Glacette Luminous White</strong> – nagyméretű, fehér, akkumulátoros, belső LED-világítással rendelkező champagne jégmedence.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A modern, hullámvonalú kialakítású jégmedence két oldalán a <strong>Perrier-Jouët Champagne</strong> márkafelirat és logó, két végén pedig a márka jellegzetes, fehér anemone virágmotívuma látható.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A beépített világítás kiemeli a feliratokat és a virágdíszítéseket, különösen esti használat során.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>A beépített, újratölthető akkumulátornak köszönhetően a jégmedence feltöltés után kábel nélkül használható és szabadon áthelyezhető.</strong> Nem igényel folyamatos hálózati csatlakozást.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Kapacitás:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>4–5 normál, 0,75 literes champagne-palack</li>\n\n\n\n<li>2–3 magnum, 1,5 literes champagne-palack</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Méretek:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Szélesség: 40 cm</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Mélység: 32 cm</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Magasság: 25 cm</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Állapot:</strong> Új, soha nem használt darab.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tartozék:</strong> Akkumulátortöltő.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Gyűjteménybe, champagne-bárokba, éttermekbe, rendezvényekre és otthoni bárokba egyaránt alkalmas.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-right\">Perrier-Jouët Belle Époque – XL Illuminated Champagne Cooler – Rechargeable, Cordless</h1>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://galeriasavaria.hu/termekek/reszletek/otthon-haztartas-kellekei/8535680\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Perrier-Jouët Belle Époque Glacette Luminous White</strong> – a large white champagne cooler with built-in LED lighting and a rechargeable battery.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This champagne cooler features an elegant, wave-shaped design, with the <strong>Perrier-Jouët Champagne</strong> logo and lettering on both sides and the Maison&#8217;s signature white anemone floral decorations at both ends.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The integrated LED lighting illuminates the logos and floral motifs, creating an attractive visual effect, particularly in the evening.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Thanks to its built-in rechargeable battery, the cooler can be used completely cordless after charging.</strong> It can be moved and positioned anywhere without requiring a continuous power connection.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Bottle capacity:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>4–5 standard champagne bottles (0.75 L)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>2–3 magnum champagne bottles (1.5 L)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Dimensions:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Width: 40 cm</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Depth: 32 cm</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Height: 25 cm</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-6 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Condition:</strong> Brand new, never used.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Included:</strong> Battery charger.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Suitable for champagne collections, champagne bars, restaurants, events, and home bars.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/champagneclub.hu/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-7 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n",
